# 🏥 NHS Referral to Treatment (RTT) Waiting Times Analysis

## Overview
End-to-end data analysis of NHS England waiting times using **real NHS data** 
from the Waiting List Minimum Data Set (WLMDS), covering September 2021 to 
January 2026 — 228 weeks of weekly national waiting time records.

## 🔑 Key Findings (Real Data)
- 📉 Latest % seen within 18 weeks: **60.7%** — vs NHS 92% target (gap of 31.3pp)
- 📈 Waiting list peaked at **7.8 million** patients in 2024
- ⚠️ Over **300,000 patients** waited 52+ weeks at peak backlog
- 📊 Strong negative correlation (-0.81) between waiting list size and 18-week performance
- 🔮 Forecast shows 92% target **will not be reached** within the next 12 months

## 📁 Project Structure
```
nhs-waiting-times/
├── data/
│   ├── WLMDS-Summary-to-25-Jan-2026.xlsx  # Real NHS data
