│   ├── nhs_analysis.png                    # Initial analysis charts
│   ├── nhs_deep_analysis.png               # Deep analysis charts
│   ├── nhs_real_analysis.png               # Real data charts
│   └── nhs_real_deep_analysis.png          # Real data deep analysis
├── notebooks/
│   ├── analysis.py                         # Initial modelled analysis
│   ├── deep_analysis.py                    # Deep analysis (modelled)
│   ├── real_data_analysis.py               # Real NHS data analysis
│   └── real_deep_analysis.py               # Real data deep analysis
├── sql/
│   └── queries.sql                         # SQL analytical queries
├── dashboard.html                          # Interactive dashboard
└── README.md
```

## 🛠️ Tools & Skills
- **Python** — Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, Seaborn, Scikit-learn, SciPy
- **SQL** — Aggregations, CASE statements, period analysis
- **Statistics** — T-tests, correlation analysis, linear regression forecasting
- **Visualisation** — Multi-panel dashboards, interactive HTML/JS charts
- **Data Source** — Real NHS England WLMDS data

